==Battleground==
*3 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
*1 [[Li'l Bun Bun]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Cala Maria]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**6 [[Li'l Bun Bun]]s spawn, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.
**5 [[Li'l Bun Bun]]s spawn, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A strange stage, somewhat similar to [[Houses of the Holy]], except with a Cala Maria. Cala Maria is the main and biggest threat in this stage, making you have to use more [[:Category:Meatshield-class Cats|meatshields]] than necessary if you want to account for this stage when doing [[First Round (Deadly)]]. However, if you do have enough meatshields, this stage will be quite easy as long as you also brought along [[Talents|talented]] [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]] and [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]]. Cameraman Cat is not needed, but they make this stage a lot easier.

==Trivia==
*There is a typo in the English version of the game, where the stage name says "4nd Round: Dusk (Merciless)" instead of "4th Round: Dusk (Merciless)".

